     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(33,33,33)\">\r\nD-RUG folks who want to work with spatial data might be interested in this week&#39;s maptimeDavis workshop by D-RUG&#39;s own Elise Hellwig. Details below.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Michele Tobias, PhD</span>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\nGeospatial Data Specialist</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\nDataLab: Data Science &amp; Informatics</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\nUC Davis Library</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n </div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n370 Shields Library</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<a href=\"tel:(530)%20752-7532\" value=\"+15307527532\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(530)752-7532</a></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</a></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\nORCID: 0000-0002-2954-8710</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n </div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Pronouns: she, her, hers</span></div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:11pt\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> geospatial Sympa List (request) &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geospatia...@lists.ucdavis.edu</a>&gt; on behalf of Matthew Conner &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mco...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Monday, November 10, 2025 2:26:34 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> geospatial Sympa List &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geosp...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [geospatial] #maptimeDavis: Intro to GIS in R</font>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt\">\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;margin:0px 0px 12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<span style=\"color:black\"><b>Intro to GIS in R</b></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:black\">\r\n<b>Date: </b>11/14/2025</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:black\">\r\n<b>Location: </b>DataLab Classroom - room 360 Shields Library</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:black\">\r\n<b>Description: </b>Intro to GIS in R is a workshop designed to get you started doing Geographic Information Science (GIS) in R. It is, roughly speaking, the R version of\r\n<a href=\"https://ucdavisdatalab.github.io/Intro-to-Desktop-GIS-with-QGIS/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucdavisdatalab.github.io/Intro-to-Desktop-GIS-with-QGIS/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464309556000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1lPK6kle_Ratq89RkzV93C\">\r\nNext Steps in QGIS</a>. We will cover setting up R for GIS, getting data in and out of R, data transformation, filtering, and geoprocessing tools, as well as some basic mapping.</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:black\">\r\n<b>Concepts Covered: </b>R, R Studio, Spatial Data</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:black\">\r\n<b>Speaker:</b></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:black\">\r\nElise Hellwig is a Research Data Scientist at the UC Davis DataLab. She has her masters in Agricultural Ecology and has worked on a wide variety of projects from database management, to environmental justice mapping, to text analysis.</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:black\">\r\n<b>Prerequisites: </b>This workshop assumes you have some experience with R. If you are new to R or would like to brush up on your skills, the\r\n<a href=\"https://ucdavisdatalab.github.io/workshop_r_basics/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucdavisdatalab.github.io/workshop_r_basics/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464309556000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0fvBJVSiMSMYYd91kXDyKo\">\r\nDataLab R Basics Reader</a> is a great place to start. It also assumes you are familiar with GIS concepts like vectors, rasters, coordinate reference systems etc, which is covered in\r\n<a href=\"https://ucdavisdatalab.github.io/Intro-to-Desktop-GIS-with-QGIS/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucdavisdatalab.github.io/Intro-to-Desktop-GIS-with-QGIS/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464309556000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1lPK6kle_Ratq89RkzV93C\">\r\nNext Steps in QGIS</a>.</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:black\">\r\n<b>Software Required: </b>Bring a laptop with <a href=\"https://ftp.osuosl.org/pub/cran/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ftp.osuosl.org/pub/cran/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464309556000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1QMwFEfKJY9PnfYTHhws0Q\">\r\nR</a> and <a href=\"https://posit.co/downloads/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://posit.co/downloads/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464309556000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1x2bNiGA-4Vin3VkllQNhR\">\r\nR Studio</a> installed. These are free and open source. R is a programming language and R Studio is a tool made by Posit that makes writing R code easier.</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:black\">\r\n<a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/maptimedavis-intro-to-gis-in-r-tickets-1681424408669?aff=oddtdtcreator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.eventbrite.com/e/maptimedavis-intro-to-gis-in-r-tickets-1681424408669?aff%3Doddtdtcreator&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464309556000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2-WGUMNukTKVnNxZA6AT1S\">RSVP</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt\">\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;margin:0px;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"padding-top:3pt;border-top:1pt solid rgb(225,225,225)\">\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;background-color:white;margin:0px;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<span style=\"color:black\">Whenever possible, #maptimeDavis Workshops will be recorded and posted on the\r\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" title=\"https://www.youtube.com/@maptimedavis95616\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@maptimedavis95616\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/@maptimedavis95616&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464309556000&amp;usg=AOvVaw382hvKDu1dGaQScjOhTPPA\">\r\n#maptimeDavis YouTube channel</a>. #maptimeDavis Studio will not be recorded to encourage open discussion. Weekly reminders will be sent on the\r\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" title=\"https://lists.ucdavis.edu/sympa/info/geospatial\" href=\"https://lists.ucdavis.edu/sympa/info/geospatial\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lists.ucdavis.edu/sympa/info/geospatial&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464309556000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1R7UhYMT67mZlrirt55io8\">\r\nGeospatial Email List</a>.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"padding-top:3pt;border-top:1pt solid rgb(225,225,225)\">\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;background-color:white;margin:0px;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;background-color:white;margin:0px;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<span style=\"color:black\">#maptimeDavis Workshops and Studio are a product of UC Davis DataLab’s\r\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" title=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/\" href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464309556000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2cRxAdtKsFBcjxpu3yS5ut\">\r\nSpatial Sciences Research Cluster</a> and are supported by the contributions and participation of our community. Please send questions to Michele Tobias\r\n<a title=\"mailto:mmt...@ucdavis.edu\" href style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">\r\nmmto...@ucdavis.edu</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;background-color:white;margin:0px;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;background-color:white;margin:0px;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;background-color:white;margin:0px;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<span style=\"color:black\">Matt Conner</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;background-color:white;margin:0px;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<span style=\"color:black\">Student Services Department</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;background-color:white;margin:0px;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<span style=\"color:black\">Library</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;background-color:white;margin:0px;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<span style=\"color:black\">University of California, Davis</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;background-color:white;margin:0px;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<span style=\"color:black\">on behalf of the #maptimeDavis council</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
